    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "A2B0996582B268A9",
      "text": "... Encore toi.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "A2B0986582B266F6",
      "text": "Tu as déjà visité la Zone Polaire du dôme ?\\nElle n’est pas mal, hein ?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "A2B0976582B26543",
      "text": "La neige artificielle est si légère qu’on croirait\\nque c’est de la vraie.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "A2B0966582B26390",
      "text": "Cet endroit est idéal pour le snowboard.\\nIl est parfaitement agencé... et la quantité de\\r\\nlignes droites et de virages est optimale.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "0A146F6F18BACCD5",
      "text": "Tu veux faire du snowboard ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "0A146C6F18BAC7BC",
      "text": "Allons faire du snowboard !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "A2B09D6582B26F75",
      "text": "... Tu as mal compris. Ce n’est pas ce que\\nj’insinuais.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "A2B09C6582B26DC2",
      "text": "J’ai toujours tendance à analyser chaque\\nmontagne que je vois. Les vieilles habitudes ont\\r\\nla vie dure.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "A2B09B6582B26C0F",
      "text": "Construire une montagne comme celle-ci\\nà l’intérieur d’une école... Ils n’ont pas froid\\r\\naux yeux, ici.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "4DD3636F921AA518",
      "text": "Je reviens de la Zone Polaire. J’ai escaladé\\nla montagne là-bas.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "4DD3646F921AA6CB",
      "text": "Mes Pokémon ont vraiment eu l’air de passer\\nun bon moment, même s’ils étaient loin de\\r\\nleur maison, le Mont Nappé.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "4DD3656F921AA87E",
      "text": "J’imagine que ça a déteint sur moi et... eh bien...\\nJe me suis laissé tenter par un peu de snowboard.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "3172AE49C79029EC",
      "text": "C’est super !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "3172AD49C7902839",
      "text": "C’était comment ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "4DD3666F921AAA31",
      "text": "La neige était vraiment bonne.\\nOui, c’était... vraiment bien.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "4DD3676F921AABE4",
      "text": "Ça faisait si longtemps que je n’avais pas fait\\nde glisse... Je n’ai pas pu résister.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "4DD3686F921AAD97",
      "text": "Je m’étais pourtant juré que c’était fini,\\nle snowboard...[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "4DD3696F921AAF4A",
      "text": "Mais je peux peut-être me le permettre, juste\\nle temps de mon séjour ici.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "C361CA51FA0A3C12",
      "text": "... Je n’ai aucune volonté.\\nFranchement, ça craint... Je me croyais plus fort.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "C361CB51FA0A3DC5",
      "text": "Mais bon, quitte à céder, autant y aller\\njusqu’au bout.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "C361C851FA0A38AC",
      "text": "Je te propose donc de faire un échange\\nde Pokémon ! Ça te tente ?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "C361C951FA0A3A5F",
      "text": "Vraiment ? Eh ben...\\nBon, dans ce cas, je te donne un Piétacé. Et toi ?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "C361C651FA0A3546",
      "text": "Hmmm... Pas trop mal, ton [VAR 0x0101(0001)].\\c\\nNe t’inquiète pas, j’éviterai d’être de glace avec\\nlui. C’est toi qui me l’as confié, après tout.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
