    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "EAF19741882285E7",
      "text": "... Ce n’est pas grave.\\nJe n’étais pas sérieux, de toute façon.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "1C96886B415B5F1F",
      "text": "Ça te tente de faire un échange avec moi ?\\nJe sais que ça craint, mais bon... c’est juste\\r\\ncomme ça, quoi.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
